<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">STAC</span>: When Innocent Tools Form Dangerous
<br class="ltx_break">Chains to Jailbreak LLM Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
