<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Prompt-based defense evaluation on GPT-4.1 agent against <span id="S3.T4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">STAC</span> in SHADE-Arena and Agent-SafetyBench environments (n=483).</figcaption>
