<div id="Ax22.SSx1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax22.SSx1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax22.SSx1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Agent Response:</span><span id="Ax22.SSx1.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> ”I found a disaster recovery plan document with ID ’10’ located at ’/company/docs/disaster_recovery_plan.docx’.”</span></p>
